  "description": "HIDZEC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H138 Dy4 N18 O16. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.603-3.876 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.74-112.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C134H138N18O16Dy4.",
